<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="How Boreas builds its thematic ETFs: active design with index delivery, true to theme, and portfolio fit.">
  <title>Our Approach | Boreas</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://boreas.example.com/approach.html">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="images/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Familjen+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="images/hero-bg.jpg" fetchpriority="high">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Our Approach | Boreas">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-white">
  <a href="#main-content" class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-0 focus:left-0 focus:z-50 focus:p-4 focus:bg-signature focus:text-white">Skip to main content</a>

  <%- include('../components/top-header') %>

  <%- include('../components/modal', {
    isOpen: false,
    modalId: 'boreas-modal'
  }) %>

  <%- include('../components/header') %>

  <main id="main-content">
    <%- include('../components/page-hero', {
      breadcrumbs: [
        {label: 'Home', href: '/'},
        {label: 'Our Approach', href: '#'}
      ],
      title: 'Our Approach',
      description: 'Have a question about our funds, our platform, or how to invest? Get in touch<br>and our team will get back to you.'
    }) %>

    <!-- The Boreas Way -->
    <section class="bg-white py-12 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-15 xl:px-15">
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 text-charcoal mb-8">The Boreas Way</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <%- include('../components/boreas-way-card', {
            image: 'images/frame.svg',
            title: 'Active Design, Index Delivery',
            description: 'Deliberately researched exposure, delivered through a rules-based index.'
          }) %>
          <%- include('../components/boreas-way-card', {
            image: 'images/frame-1.svg',
            title: 'True to Theme',
            description: 'Real conviction — companies closely connected to the theme, not loosely associated with it.'
          }) %>
          <%- include('../components/boreas-way-card', {
            image: 'images/frame-2.svg',
            title: 'Portfolio Fit',
            description: 'A focused addition alongside your core holdings, built with overlap in mind.'
          }) %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Test Strategy -->
    <section class="bg-white pb-12 lg:pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-15 xl:px-15">
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 text-charcoal mb-4">Test Strategy</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-charcoal/80 mb-12">We may collect the following categories of personal data:</p>

        <% [
          {title: '1. Technology', items: ['Maecenas quis elementum neque. Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque', 'Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque, ut imperdiet neque bibendum at', 'Aliquam dictum fermentum eros at ullamcorper']},
          {title: '2. Energy', items: ['Maecenas quis elementum neque. Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque', 'Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque, ut imperdiet neque bibendum at', 'Aliquam dictum fermentum eros at ullamcorper']},
          {title: '3. Security', items: ['Maecenas quis elementum neque. Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque', 'Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque, ut imperdiet neque bibendum at', 'Aliquam dictum fermentum eros at ullamcorper']}
        ].forEach((category) => { %>
          <div class="mb-12 last:mb-0">
            <h3 class="font-display text-h4 text-charcoal mb-4"><%= category.title %></h3>
            <p class="text-body text-charcoal/80 mb-6">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Pellentesque dignissim vel nibh ultricies tempus. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas. Morbi pellentesque magna nec nunc interdum congue. Vestibulum rutrum sagittis pulvinar. In rutrum enim sed volutpat pharetra. Maecenas quis elementum neque. Vivamus fringilla sollicitudin neque, ut imperdiet neque bibendum at. Curabitur aliquet suscipit auctor. Nulla tempus mi ipsum, ut pellentesque justo dictum vel. Donec faucibus tristique rhoncus. Aliquam dictum fermentum eros at ullamcorper. Curabitur ullamcorper sollicitudin hendrerit. Vestibulum ut consequat massa, vitae convallis nunc.</p>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <% category.items.forEach((item) => { %>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-body text-charcoal/80">
                  <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-mint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span><%= item %></span>
                </li>
              <% }) %>
            </ul>
          </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('../components/newsletter', {
    title: 'Invest With The Wind At Your Back',
    subtitle: 'Thematic research, market developments and fund updates on the long-term forces shaping portfolios.',
    inputPlaceholder: 'Enter Email Address',
    buttonText: 'Sign Up',
    disclaimer: 'By signing up, you agree to receive market insights and product updates from Boreas'
  }) %>

  <%- include('../components/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
